    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιβδύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, expl. by Gramm. as 
			Aeol.
		 for *<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιδύω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sink</i> or <i>submerge in the
				sea</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆας ἁλιβδύουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					269
				</span></i>
			 : <i>hide</i>, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιβδύσασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					351
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				63.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
